Short:        GUI 4 PhxAss assembler. Version 1.0.
Author:       Andrzej Krynski (tichy@polbox.com)
Uploader:     tichy polbox com
Type:         dev/asm
Version:      1.3
Replaces:     dev/asm/phxgui.lha
Requires:     OS2.0+ and PhxAss
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

Very small (see lha output) interface that allows you to set all
CLI arguments required by PhxAss. This is the first public release and
is not finished but fully workable.

*Fixed bug with string gadgeds refreshing: Asl requesters  works now with
string gadgets together!
You can put both paths manually into "FOROM"&"TO" string gadgets too.
*Fixed bug with not cleared buffer to SystemTags function (internal,
don`t bother it).

 
GUI4PhxAss is CARDWARE. (I want to see if my work is really needed ;-)).
Most actual source code is avaible from my home page:
http://www.polbox.com/t/tichy/ (sometimes this site doesn`t work properly,
do not blame me;-) )

TESTED WITH A1200+BLIZZARD12030/IV+MC68882/50MHZ+...+...++ WB39.29

